      <h2 id="the-cosmic-chronology">The cosmic chronology</h2>

      <p>The river of time names seven great ages; the chronology names every milestone inside them. We pick seven moments from each age — forty‑nine in all — chosen as the instants when the Universe stops being one kind of thing and becomes another: the first nucleus, the first star, the first ocean, the first cell, the first written word. Together they trace the full fourteen‑billion‑year arc, beat by beat. The card below opens the live, scroll‑driven timeline; the preview inside lists the seven turning points within each age.</p>

